###  https://www.cobrain-project.eu/ontology/cobrain#TiC-AlCu
:TiC-AlCu rdf:type owl:Class ;
          owl:equivalentClass [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                owl:onProperty :materialNickname ;
