          <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wear Rate"@en ;
          :elucidation "The rate of material loss from a surface due to wear, expressed as lost mass or volume per unit sliding distance or time (or, for the specific wear rate, per unit load and sliding distance)."@en .


###  https://www.cobrain-project.eu/ontology/cobrain#WearTest
